# tests/winterfest/wf_mail_probe.commands
#
# Console commands cs16-linux-base sends after the map starts, 0.4 s apart. This
# is the operator half: the same cache view an admin gets from the server
# console, on the same functions the chat commands use.
#
# `wf_mail_state` with no target prints one line per connected client
# ("unread=… cached=… core_pending=… reads=…") plus its five most recent
# entries — the log line the expect file asserts.
wf_mail_state
